{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T14:48:45.229Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the discard/commit fixes in `src/core/vcs/git-vcs-write.ts` and added `tests/vcs-discard-commit.test.ts`.\n\n**`discard`**\n- Returns before any git call (worktree assertions included) when given no paths.\n- Resolves HEAD's files via `git ls-tree`, unstages files HEAD lacks with `git rm --cached`, restores HEAD paths in both index and tree with `git restore --source=HEAD --staged --worktree`, then `git clean -fd`. Ignored files remain untouched, and a staged new file is removed from both index and tree.\n\n**`commit`**\n- Stages the given paths and commits only them with `git commit --only -- <paths>`, leaving other staged changes staged; no paths still commits the index as-is.\n- `commitMessage` now accepts the path list.\n\n**New test** (`tests/vcs-discard-commit.test.ts`) against a temp repo with a linked worktree on `osq/001-a`:\n- Discard with no paths: records that zero git commands run, untracked file stays.\n- Discard a staged new file: new file gone, staged tracked file matches HEAD, status empty.\n- Commit leaves other staged paths: new commit has only `b.txt`, `a.txt` still staged.\n- Commit with no paths commits the index.\n\n**Verification**: task verify passes (4/4), `tests/vcs-write.test.ts` passes unchanged (16/16), and the proposal verify `pnpm verify` exits 0 (2265 + 88 tests, 0 fail; lint clean).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/091-dead-path-building-blocks/.run/results/1.md`."}}
